stom..._05.07.2025_15-40-33.png", "id": "1385117182712128", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619055_1385117189378794_4685697881958893191_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vQIG9ZPkhR0Q7kNvwH4DpHU&_nc_oc=Adp0QTySxDJ9gZRDM1H6ESHz89qTuAmHc3BU9YnvZIYIBlKWzd81mvQS-0tC7u2NlTg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFaF-hUwIpYvA0Z27m3Uun-CI-i09-c6R9HHuku7U1vlg&oe=6A8D674B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Voidbound", "keywords": [], "long_description": "(Game currently in closed early access)\nVoidbound is here!\nVoidbound is home to the NebulaNex Station!\nHere we have a variety of different activities to enjoy and scenic spaces to unwind and relax!\n\nWanna play zero-g games with your friends? \nWanna gaze into the endless abyss of space? \nWanna join a welcoming community of robots new and old?\nAll of your robot needs can be found right here at the NebulaNex station!\n\nYou may also want to take a visit to the Nebula Plaza, the first ever space mall located right on the NebulaNex!\n\nSo take a visit to the NebulaNex and who knows, it may become your new home!", "short_description": "(Game currently in closed early access)\nVoidbound is here!\nVoidbound is home to the NebulaNex Station!\nHere we have a variety of different activities to enjoy and scenic spaces to unwind and relax!\n\nThe NebulaNex station is home to all of your robot needs, including a full, in-station mall!\n\nSo take a visit to the NebulaNex and who knows, it may become your new home!"}]}, "developer_name": "Pulse Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/voidbound/privacy-policy?authuser=0", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Pulse Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/voidbound/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id":